h initiatives for the world’s hardest problems.</h1></section><section class=\"offer-section\" id=\"offer\"><div class=\"offer-copy\"><h2>We help you design and build new initiatives, funding models and innovation programmes.</h2><a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"#approach\">Our approach <span>↓</span></a></div><figure class=\"workshop-photo\"><img src=\"/zip-preview/assets/5517254b78dd300c.jpg\" alt=\"Four workshop participants discussing creative materials and sketches around a table\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></section><section class=\"about\" id=\"about\"><h2>The world's hardest problems fall between what governments prioritise, what charities can fund and what investors can back.</h2><div><p>Talented people get stuck in slow-moving institutions.</p><p>Promising ideas struggle to get a chance.</p><p>And funding often comes with conditions that don’t fit the problem.</p></div></section><section id=\"approach\"><div class=\"approach-heading\"><h2>We take a problem-first approach.</h2></div><div class=\"steps\"><article class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-diagram\"><svg class=\"coordinate-field field-1\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"coordinate-grid\" d=\"M20 30H280M20 70H280M20 110H280M20 150H280M50 15V165M100 15V165M150 15V165M200 15V165M250 15V165\"></path><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"38\" cy=\"42\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:0;--dx:-8px;--dy:-9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"75\" cy=\"124\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:1;--dx:0px;--dy:9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"102\" cy=\"63\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:2;--dx:8px;--dy:-9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"131\" cy=\"144\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:3;--dx:-8px;--dy:9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"163\" cy=\"85\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:4;--dx:0px;--dy:-9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"198\" cy=\"35\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:5;--dx:8px;--dy:9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"218\" cy=\"123\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:6;--dx:-8px;--dy:-9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"261\" cy=\"69\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:7;--dx:0px;--dy:9px\"></circle></svg></div><h3>Understand the problem</h3><p>Bring together research, lived experience and expert insight to find opportunities for change.</p></article><article class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-diagram\"><svg class=\"coordinate-field field-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"coordinate-grid\" d=\"M20 30H280M20 70H280M20 110H280M20 150H280M50 15V165M100 15V165M150 15V165M200 15V165M250 15V165\"></path><path class=\"network-lines\" d=\"M50 110L100 70L150 110L200 70L250 110M100 70L150 30L200 70M150 110V150\"></path><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"110\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:0;--dx:-8px;--dy:-9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"100\" cy=\"70\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:1;--dx:0px;--dy:9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"150\" cy=\"30\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:2;--dx:8px;--dy:-9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"150\" cy=\"110\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:3;--dx:-8px;--dy:9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"200\" cy=\"70\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:4;--dx:0px;--dy:-9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"250\" cy=\"110\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:5;--dx:8px;--dy:9px\"></circle><circle class=\"coordinate-dot\" cx=\"150\" cy=\"150\" r=\"3\" style=\"--i:6;--dx:-8px;--dy:-9px\"></circle></svg></div><h3>Build the vehicle</h3><p>Design new initiatives with unconventional partnerships, smart funding models and entrepreneurial talent.</p></article><article class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-diagram\"><svg class=\"coordinate-field field-3\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"coordinate-grid\" d=\"M20 30H280M20 70H280M20 110H280M20 150H280M50 15V165M100 15V165M150 15V165M200 15V165M250 15V165\"></path><path class=\"network-lines\" d=\"M150 90L50 30M150 90L250 30M150 90L50 150M150 90L25